Deterministic NPU self-test model (Conv 3x3 + ReLU, input [1,1,8,8], output [1,4,8,8], float32 NCHW),
installed by BR2_PACKAGE_RKNN_RUNTIME_NPU_TEST_MODEL.

  RK3588/npu_test.rknn        RKNN model for RK3588
  RK3566_RK3568/npu_test.rknn RKNN model for RK3566/RK3568
  npu_test_input.bin          fixed input, 256 bytes
  npu_test_expected.bin       golden output, 1024 bytes

Built with RKNN Toolkit2 1.6.0+81f21f4d (Python 3.10, numpy 1.26.4, onnx 1.14.1,
onnxruntime 1.16.0), do_quantization=False. The Toolkit2 version must match RKNN_RUNTIME_VERSION.

Generator and converter: test_peripheral repository, tools/npu_test/. To regenerate:

  cd tools/npu_test
  python generate_npu_test_model.py
  python convert_to_rknn.py --target rk3588 --target rk3568
  cp out/rk3588/npu_test.rknn <this dir>/RK3588/
  cp out/rk3568/npu_test.rknn <this dir>/RK3566_RK3568/
  cp out/npu_test_input.bin out/npu_test_expected.bin <this dir>/

See tools/npu_test/README.md for the Toolkit2 environment setup.
